<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 1917) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h2>
<ul>
<li>Small improvements.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<div class="earlier">Earlier updates</div>
<h3>1.0 (build 1910) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Small improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1904) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Small improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1897) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Small improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1894) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> several folders dropped together added only the last one's pictures.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1891) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Drop any folder:</b> its movies, sequences and pictures are found, all the way down, with a Cancel button while it works.</li>
<li>Progress and messages now sit under the title strip, where the control bar can't cover them.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1888) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Small improvements to following a live review.</li>
</ul>
<h3>1.0 (build 1885) <span class="when">Oct 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed:</b> in a live review with several Macs, playback could stutter, the picture jump and menus refuse to stay open while the review was sent again and again. This version no longer adds to that.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
